      "DAC": "Distinct artifacts linked to the candidate through inferred ontology paths divided by the scenario artifact universe.",
      "DC": "Adjusted defensive-relation completeness: observed unique (ATT&CK technique, D3FEND relation) pairs divided by the scenario relation universe, multiplied by 1 - redundant_steps / matched_steps.",
